      "value": "For every type X, index type B, and type Q endowed with a faithful FunLike evaluation as functions Set(X)→[0,∞] and an OuterMeasureClass structure, every μ∈Q, every countable B, and every family A:B→Set(X), μ(⋃_i A_i)≤∑_i μ(A_i). An OuterMeasureClass means these functions vanish on the empty set, are monotone and are countably subadditive."
